    "body":  {
                 "storage":  {
                                 "value":  "\u003cp\u003eDesign : \u003ca href=\"https://xd.adobe.com/view/5f785d59-2925-4ea4-9d7f-bda2349898bc-0a2b/\"\u003eCancellation_Of_Disconnection)Of_The_Power\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAs a\u003c/strong\u003e system user\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eI want to\u003c/strong\u003e be able to generate and attached file (s)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSo that \u003c/strong\u003eI will have the possibility to generate attachment file (s) through Json.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp /\u003e\u003chr /\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e\u0026ldquo;Cancellation of disconnection\u0026rdquo;\u003c/strong\u003e contains information about the customer, grid operator, PODs, and other relevant details. The system should generate a document which should be provided to the grid operator .\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAfter clicking the \u0026quot;Save and Execute\u0026quot; button, a document should be generated using a template. (After execution, it is not possible to change the data inside this object.)\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf the operation is not successful after clicking the \u0026quot;Save and Execute\u0026quot; button, display an error and do not generate the file.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe document is generated using a template that is added as a sub-object in the \u003cstrong\u003e\u0026ldquo;Cancellation of disconnection\u0026rdquo;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe sub-object is optional. If the object does not have a template, the Document should not be generated.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf the template sub-object includes several number of templates, each Document should be generated for each template.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe request for disconnection template can have the following formats: XLSX, PDF, or DOCX.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGenerated document should be added in File sub object.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe document gerating base on Template (JSON)\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://asterbit.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/Phoenix/pages/234586117\" data-card-appearance=\"inline\"\u003ehttps://asterbit.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/Phoenix/pages/234586117\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(191,38,0);\"\u003eDocument name format is selected automatically by another process\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe document includes a signing process. For this purpose, a dedicated table exists in the base data and should be used specifically for signing\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e",
                                 "representation":  "storage",
                                 "embeddedContent":  [

                                                     ],
                                 "_expandable":  {
                                                     "content":  "/rest/api/content/234749968"
                                                 }
                             },
                 "view":  {
                              "value":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstyle\u003e[data-colorid=bhyogd672g]{color:#bf2600} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=bhyogd672g]{color:#ff6640}\u003c/style\u003eDesign : \u003ca href=\"https://xd.adobe.com/view/5f785d59-2925-4ea4-9d7f-bda2349898bc-0a2b/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003eCancellation_Of_Disconnection)Of_The_Power\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAs a\u003c/strong\u003e system user\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eI want to\u003c/strong\u003e be able to generate and attached file (s)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSo that \u003c/strong\u003eI will have the possibility to generate attachment file (s) through Json.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp /\u003e\u003chr /\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e\u0026ldquo;Cancellation of disconnection\u0026rdquo;\u003c/strong\u003e contains information about the customer, grid operator, PODs, and other relevant details. The system should generate a document which should be provided to the grid operator .\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAfter clicking the \u0026quot;Save and Execute\u0026quot; button, a document should be generated using a template. (After execution, it is not possible to change the data inside this object.)\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf the operation is not successful after clicking the \u0026quot;Save and Execute\u0026quot; button, display an error and do not generate the file.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe document is generated using a template that is added as a sub-object in the \u003cstrong\u003e\u0026ldquo;Cancellation of disconnection\u0026rdquo;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe sub-object is optional. If the object does not have a template, the Document should not be generated.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf the template sub-object includes several number of templates, each Document should be generated for each template.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe request for disconnection template can have the following formats: XLSX, PDF, or DOCX.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGenerated document should be added in File sub object.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe document gerating base on Template (JSON)\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://asterbit.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/Phoenix/pages/234586117\" data-card-appearance=\"inline\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003ehttps://asterbit.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/Phoenix/pages/234586117\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-colorid=\"bhyogd672g\"\u003eDocument name format is selected automatically by another process\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe document includes a signing process. For this purpose, a dedicated table exists in the base data and should be used specifically for signing\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e",
